Players must solve puzzles, collect objects, and avoid the dangers in every corner, walking in circle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immersive sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound effects that suit the situation, such as the rumble of lightning, the swish of a door, and the sound of different footsteps depending on the surface being travelled on.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use UE5 features to deliver a visually stunning experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game genre: Horror, Walking simulator.</u> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Average time to complete the game: 40 - 60 min</u></strong></p>",
